mented yet. Also include a key social = an object with: sentiment (one blunt sentence on overall social-page health), weak (array of 2 to 3 short strings naming the weakest pages or platforms and why), focus (array of 2 to 3 short strings on where to double down for growth), improve (array of 2 to 3 concrete actions). Base social ONLY on this per-page per-platform data (numbers are current followers; percentages are day-over-day change):\n"+socialSummary;
